What shipped this quarter -- Example Platform newsletter, issue 84

Quarterly platform update
  We shipped 42 improvements this quarter, including a rewritten indexer,
  faster full-text search and a new billing dashboard.
  https://news.example.com/r/2024/q3-platform-update?uid=48213&src=nl

Migrating to the v3 API
  The v2 API enters maintenance on 1 March. This guide walks through the
  four breaking changes and how to adapt your client.
  https://docs.example.com/guides/v3-migration?utm_source=newsletter

Customer story: Vandelay Industries
  How a mid-size importer cut their nightly batch window from six hours to
  eleven minutes.
  https://news.example.com/r/stories/vandelay?uid=48213

Webinar: scaling mailbox storage
  Join our storage team on 14 February for a live walkthrough of tiered
  blob storage and a Q&A.
  https://events.example.com/webinars/mailbox-storage-2024

Security advisory ADV-2024-0112
  A moderate-severity issue in the attachment scanner has been fixed in
  3.8.4. Upgrading is recommended.
  https://security.example.com/advisories/ADV-2024-0112

Hiring: senior systems engineer
  We are looking for someone who enjoys profilers, flame graphs and shaving
  microseconds off hot loops.
  https://careers.example.com/jobs/senior-systems-engineer

